  "html": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/BBBC.jpg\" title=\"BBBC.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"304\" src=\"/images/BBBC.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/BBBC.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><b>Balzack's Base Camp can be accessed through a portal from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> Level 5 or a one way portal from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Pinnacle</a>.  A portal leads out to <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a> Level 1.  There is also an Obelisk which will allow you to return once you use it.</b>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"NPC.27s\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">NPC's</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/TDA_Agent_Anise_Rawgers\" title=\"TDA Agent Anise Rawgers\">TDA Agent Anise Rawgers</a>, quest giver\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Javier_Valdez_the_Java_Distributor\" title=\"Javier Valdez the Java Distributor\">Javier Valdez the Java Distributor</a>, quest giver\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
